  "reflectionText": "John wrote to the elect lady: I rejoice greatly that I have found certain of your children walking in truth. Love one another. This is love, that we should walk according to his commandments. What is it to be greeted by news that your children are walking in the truth, when you had not been there to see it for yourself?"
